flowchart TD
  KEY[Client generates local private key and public key] --> REQ[Enrollment request: public key plus login context]
  LOGIN[Google OIDC login] --> TOKEN[ID token sent over authenticated HTTPS]
  TOKEN --> CHECK[Company service validates token and VPN authorization]
  REQ --> CHECK
  CHECK --> CA[Company CA issues certificate for approved public key]
  CA --> CLIENT[Client has certificate, local private key, and VPN trust configuration]
  CLIENT --> IKE[Later: IKE_SA_INIT then certificate-based IKE_AUTH]
  IKE --> ESP[ESP traffic with DH-derived session keys]
